# claude-lens.config: operational knobs for the local Claude cross-model review lens.
#
# The model and effort are the review plugin's claude_model and claude_effort settings, passed by
# the skill as CLAUDE_LENS_MODEL / CLAUDE_LENS_EFFORT. The read-only posture (safe mode, restricted
# Read/Grep/Glob tools, a tracked-file snapshot) is fixed in scripts/claude-lens.sh. These bounds are
# assign-if-unset, so a pre-set env var wins for a one-off run.

: "${CLAUDE_LENS_MAX_INLINE_FILES:=50}"
: "${CLAUDE_LENS_MAX_INLINE_DIFF_BYTES:=262144}"
: "${CLAUDE_LENS_TIMEOUT:=900}"
